# Own live recordings (live_demo.py --record) land in ml/data/landmarks + ml/data/manifest_own.csv and
# live test logs in ml/runs/live/*.jsonl -> both covered by ml/data/ and ml/runs/ above. Keep them out of
# git: they are personal (body/hand landmarks of real people).
*.jsonl
# Skeleton previews (export_skeleton.py --preview) are debug images, regenerable.
ml/exports/**/*_preview.png
# NOTE: ml/artifacts/ (model.onnx, label_map.json, audio/*.wav, ...), ml/mp_models/*.task and
# ml/exports/skeleton/label_XX.json (sign-guide animation for the kiosk) are intentionally tracked:
# the backend Predictor and kiosk need them at runtime.
